@host = https://localhost:7077
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOGIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@module = email
@runId = REPLACE_WITH_RUN_ID
@position = 1
@submissionId = 280e2b2b-6880-4c22-9146-54d571a389bc

### Sign in using ToeflExam.Api.http first, then paste accessToken above.
GET {{host}}/api/writing/configuration
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Overview of all three Writing modules
GET {{host}}/api/writing
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ordered path. To practice discussion, set module = academic-discussion.
GET {{host}}/api/practice/writing/{{module}}/path
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Start or resume. Copy response id into runId.
POST {{host}}/api/practice/writing/{{module}}/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Read current activity before writing your response.
GET {{host}}/api/practice/writing/{{module}}/runs/{{runId}}/steps/{{position}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Enter YOUR response. New activity = new UUID; network retry = same UUID.
# A non-empty response calls Gemini and can consume API quota.
POST {{host}}/api/practice/writing/{{module}}/runs/{{runId}}/steps/{{position}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "submissionId": "{{submissionId}}",
  "answer": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_ENGLISH_RESPONSE"
}

### Read temporary report data (no attachment); available for at most 30 minutes.
GET {{host}}/api/practice/writing/{{module}}/runs/{{runId}}/steps/{{position}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Progress and nextPosition
GET {{host}}/api/practice/writing/{{module}}/runs/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Only available after 100% completion
POST {{host}}/api/practice/writing/{{module}}/runs/{{runId}}/restart
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### History
GET {{host}}/api/practice/writing/{{module}}/runs?skip=0&take=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
